
### Crea una nuova spesa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "description": "Cena",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Carta",
  "category": "PIZZA"
}

### Recupera tutte le spese
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Accept: application/json


### Importazione multipla
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/import
Content-Type: application/json

[]
### Create expense - valid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "description": "Pranzo",
  "amount": 15.50,
  "category": "BAR_RISTORAZIONE",
  "paymentMethod": "Carta"
}

### Create expense - missing category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "description": "Cena",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Carta"
}

### Create expense - negative amount
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "description": "Test importo negativo",
  "amount": 10.50,
  "category": "ALIMENTARI",
  "paymentMethod": "Carta"
}

### Create expense - optional description
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "amount": 8.50,
  "category": "ALIMENTARI",
  "paymentMethod": "Carta"
}

